      "content": "the problem is i dont think there is anyone to navigate it with. it's just me in this house and the rooms are getting darker every day. it feels so exhausting to try and hold onto these flickering lights. it just feels like a losing battle, you know? like it would be easier to just stop fighting it and let the dark come.",
